    "mime_type": "image/webp",
    "width": 694,
    "height": 781,
    "alt_text": "Hide the Pain Harold meme showing an older man forcing a smile while holding a telephone. The text reads: When the general SEO agency celebrates a 200% spike in traffic... but it's all just people calling the front desk for free medical advice.",
    "caption": "",
    "description": "A relatable veterinary industry meme illustrating the frustration clinic owners and receptionists face when non-specialized marketing agencies drive irrelevant, low-quality traffic to their website. Instead of generating booked appointments and high-margin surgical leads, general SEO often results in unqualified phone calls from 'Dr. Google' searchers looking for free pet health advice.",
