    "alt_text": "eterinary SEO imprortance = Practice Visibility\" that states \"93% of pet owners won't go further than the first page of Google,\" visually represented by a large group of gray people icons and a small group of blue people and a dog icon to illustrate found vs. unfound audiences",
    "caption": "",
    "description": "A clean, modern flat-design infographic with a subtle light-gray background featuring a repeating pattern of paw prints and a stethoscope.\n\nThe header text at the top, in large, bold dark-blue letters, reads: \"Veterinary SEO = Practice Visibility\".\n\nBelow the header, the infographic is split into two primary visual elements:\n\nOn the left: A large grid of simplified human icons. The first columns are composed of gray icons (approximately 30 people). To the right of this group is a fourth, shorter column of three blue icons, with the bottom blue icon uniquely depicting a person standing next to a small dog.\n\nOn the right: A prominent, solid blue rectangular panel that contains:\n\nLarge text: \"93%\"\n\nBelow it, text: \"of pet owners won't go further than the first page of Google\".\n\nNext to this text is an icon of a simple veterinary clinic building with a medical cross on the facade.\n\nAt the very bottom, there are two legend lines acting as a key:\n\nLine 1, preceded by a single gray person icon, reads: \"These pet owners won’t find your clinic!\"\n\nLine 2, preceded by a single blue person icon, reads: \"These pet owners may see your practice...\"",
